  "description": "Sneat (Bootstrap 5) theme for the WA.Core Blazor UI: the shared FViewer markup (forms, grids, dashboards, charts, calendar, workflow, processes, builders) on an Aether-compatible Bootstrap kit, plus the BPMS layout (top bar, left menu, footer, login) and all theme CSS/JS. Built on SI.WA.UI.Core.",
  "id": "SI.WA.UI.Sneat",
